{1}{Who ... are ... you...? [The voice that comes from the skeleton is like the wind through dead, brittle leaves.  It echoes strangely in your mind, as if he was speaking to you from within.]  Who ... comes... here... after ... all ... this ... time?}{Who ... are ... you...? [The voice that comes from the skeleton is like the wind through dead, brittle leaves.  It echoes strangely in your mind, as if he was speaking to you from within.]  Who ... comes... here... after ... all ... this ... time?}{}{1}{}{}
