{17}{Liisssttteeennn .... [The voice is growing faint.]  Travel ... north ... to ... the ... cave ... the ... Dragon.  Find ... the ... Pool ... bring ... back ... the ... bloooodddd .... [He points to a place on your map.  The most imperceptible whisper.]  Pleeeeaaaassseee ... I ... want ... to ... liiivvveee....}{Liisssttteeennn .... [The voice is growing faint.]  Travel ... north ... to ... the ... cave ... the ... Dragon.  Find ... the ... Pool ... bring ... back ... the ... bloooodddd .... [He points to a place on your map.  The most imperceptible whisper.]  Pleeeeaaaassseee ... I ... want ... to ... liiivvveee....}{}{5}{}{lf1 1, mm 55}
